        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek 84052RECKN, Select Knurled Cabinet Handle</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Modern Knurled Cabinet Pull is completely customizable. Choose from several different sizes ranging from 3.5 inch to 54 inch center to center lengths. The stem mounts and the bar pull are seperate pieces fitted together to order so you can choose any combination of finishes that suits your style. The knurled texture has maximum design impact. This modern cabinet pull is perfect for your kitchen remodel.  \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-RECKN-specifications.gif?v=1774579972\" width=\"600\" height=\"157\" border=\"0\" atl=\"Emtek Knurled Cabinet Pull Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Emtek Select Knurled Cabinet Pulls:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Comes packaged with installation screws.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-84052-specifications.pdf?v=1704262418\"><b>Emtek Select Cabinet Pull Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 13 Sizes:</b></p>\r\n<table style=\"text;font-family: Verdana, helvetica, arial;font-size: 12px;color: #000000;\" width=\"600\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"3\" cellspacing=\"0\">\r\n<tr>\r\n<td width=\"50%\">\r\n<b>EMT-84052:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length Center to Center: 3-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 4-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-3/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>EMT-84053:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length Center to Center: 4\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 4-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-3/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>EMT-84054:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length Center to Center: 5\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 5-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-3/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>EMT-84055:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length Center to Center: 6\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 6-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-3/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<b>EMT-84056:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length Center to Center: 8\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 8-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-3/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>EMT-84057:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length Center to Center: 10\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 10-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-3/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>EMT-84058:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length Center to Center: 12\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 12-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-3/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n<td width=\"50%\">\r\n<br>\r\n<b>EMT-84059:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length Center to Center: 16\"</li>\r\n<li>3 Mounts</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 16-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-3/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>EMT-84062:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length Center to Center: 18\"</li>\r\n<li>2 Mounts</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 18-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-3/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>EMT-84060:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length Center to Center: 20\"</li>\r\n<li>3 Mounts</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 20-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-3/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>EMT-84061:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length Center to Center: 24\"</li>\r\n<li>3 Mounts</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 24-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-3/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>EMT-84063:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length Center to Center: 36\"</li>\r\n<li>3 Mounts</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 36-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-3/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>EMT-84064:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length Center to Center: 54\"</li>\r\n<li>4 Mounts</li>\r\n<li>Total Length: 54-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-3/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-Finish7SCU.jpg?v=1704354538\" width=\"600\" height=\"114\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Emtek Finish Chart\">\r\n</p>",
